---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const title = "Premium Domain Valuation Guide 2026 | What Is phx.beauty Worth? | SDL";
const description =
  "How premium domains like phx.beauty are valued: length, extension, geo affluence, commercial intent, comps ($8k–$90k), and how to make a winning offer via secure escrow.";
const image =
  "https://imagedelivery.net/-sPAUAWeA405NiWJ0SNIQA/cf14abf6-727d-4088-5ad4-8812c6c3c000/public";
---

<Layout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  ogImage={image}
  canonicalPath="/valuation-guide/"
  keywords="domain valuation guide, premium domain worth, how to value a domain, investment domains, expired domains, brandable domains, buy .beauty domains"
>
  <main id="main" class="min-h-screen bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-950 dark:text-slate-200">
    <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16">
      <a href="/" class="text-sm font-medium text-amber-700 hover:underline">← Back to phx.beauty</a>
      <p class="mt-6 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[2px] text-amber-700">Valuation Guide • Updated 2026</p>
      <h1 class="heading-serif mt-2 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tighter text-slate-900 md:text-5xl dark:text-white">
        What makes phx.beauty a premium domain?
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        Nine characters, geo-premium prefix, industry-exact extension, and a top-decile market.
        Here&rsquo;s exactly how sophisticated buyers underwrite it.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">1. Scarcity: 3 + 6, pronounceable, exact-meaning</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        PHX = Phoenix shorthand; beauty = medspa, skincare, aesthetics. Short domains (&lt;10 chars) with
        clear semantics trade at multiples of longer alternatives. There is exactly one phx.beauty.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">2. Extension fit: .beauty beats generic</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        For medspas, aesthetics, and skincare, .beauty converts intent better than a forced .com.
        Buyers report higher recall and cheaper branded search CPCs on exact-fit extensions.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">3. Market: Phoenix / Scottsdale affluence</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        <li>Large high-net-worth population with strong wellness spending.</li>
        <li>Year-round resort, golf, and 55+ active-adult demand.</li>
        <li>Strong medical aesthetics and longevity-medicine growth.</li>
        <li>Scottsdale / Paradise Valley / Arcadia luxury positioning.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">4. Comps: $8k–$90k</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        Publicly reported premium beauty / geo-beauty sales (2023–2026) cluster $8k–$90k
        depending on length and commercial intent. phx.beauty is offered at market — serious offers from $8,000.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">5. How to make a winning offer</h2>
      <ol class="mt-3 list-decimal space-y-1 pl-5 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        <li>State intended use (medspa, skincare, beauty destination…).</li>
        <li>Lead with a serious number (≥ $8k) — lowballs are declined.</li>
        <li>Confirm escrow + timeline (push vs. Auth-code).</li>
        <li>Ask about bundles (sdl.hair, sdl.contact, sdl.life) for leverage.</li>
      </ol>

      <div class="mt-10 rounded-3xl bg-slate-900 p-8 text-center dark:border dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-black">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Underwrite it yourself — then own it.</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-white/70">Confidential, escrow-protected, 24–48h response.</p>
        <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
          <a href="/#inquire-offer" class="tap-target inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-3xl bg-white px-8 font-semibold text-slate-900">Make an Offer →</a>
          <a href="/faq/" class="tap-target inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-3xl border border-white/25 px-8 font-semibold text-white">Read buying FAQ</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
